
Rsigserver.java - One-page Java program that forwards ofmpub/rsigserver
                  requests to maple/rsigserver and copies the resulting
                  byte stream back out to stdout.

rsig.war - File installed on ofmpub that contains byte-compiled Rsigserver.

These should be replaced with a simple EPA Firewall rule.

